Input: {"question": "What is the medium of \"Loitering with Intent\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "start": 0, "end": 87, "text": "Loitering with Intent Loitering with Intent is a novel by Scottish author Muriel Spark."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "start": 88, "end": 173, "text": "Published in 1981 by Bodley Head, it was short-listed for the Booker Prize that year."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "start": 174, "end": 370, "text": "It contains many autobiographical references to Spark's early career and was reprinted in 2001 by New Directions, in the US, and in 2007 by Virago Press in the UK (with a foreword by Mark Lawson)."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "start": 371, "end": 475, "text": "Fleur Talbot is struggling to complete her first novel, \"Warrender Chase\", in London in the early 1950s."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "start": 476, "end": 600, "text": "She manages to secure a job working for Sir Quentin Oliver as secretary to the Autobiographical Association, whose eccentric"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d01", "start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "written by Sir Quentin in Loitering with Intent ."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d01", "start": 50, "end": 326, "text": "They are presented in such a truthful way that some of the words are omitted as it is explained that “ They had been torn roughly , so that some of the words at the beginning of each line were partly missing and equally at the end of the lines on the reverse sides ” ( 184 ) ."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d01", "start": 327, "end": 450, "text": "Towards the end of the novel , a simple letter appears which comes from the publisher to invite an appointment with Fleur ."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d01", "start": 451, "end": 498, "text": "The existence of some biographies , diaries , a"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 0, "end": 112, "text": "Characters in Loitering with Intent appear to tackle reality with what they learn from the film Warrender Chase."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 113, "end": 182, "text": "Fleur and Sir Quentin are alike in their turning to it for reference."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 183, "end": 254, "text": "Sir Quentin follows the scenes and actions depicted in Warrender Chase."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 255, "end": 366, "text": "Fleur plays the role of a detective who investigates Sir Quentin’s conspiracy and his theft of her manuscripts."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 367, "end": 478, "text": "Sometimes, when she is in a dilemma as to what to do, she depends on scenes from Warrender Chase for a way out."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d02", "start": 479, "end": 523, "text": "Once, when Dottie asks her why she cannot..."}, "D4S1": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 0, "end": 29, "text": "corner of the literary world."}, "D4S2": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 30, "end": 67, "text": "A very British film in many respects!"}, "D4S3": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 68, "end": 160, "text": "Reply ↓ Brian Joseph August 7, 2018 at 7:24 am I have been meaning to watch Spark for years."}, "D4S4": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 161, "end": 221, "text": "The plot and characters of this one sound like a lot of fun."}, "D4S5": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 222, "end": 313, "text": "I also find that films, that incorporate fictional books within them, to be generally neat."}, "D4S6": {"document_number": 4, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d03", "start": 314, "end": 458, "text": "Reply ↓ JacquiWine Post author August 7, 2018 at 7:55 am Well, this would be the year to watch Spark given that it’s the centenary of her birth."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0024-a13a58ca5ac3:d00:c0", "entity": "Loitering with Intent", "scope": "medium", "claim": "Loitering with Intent is a novel by Scottish author Muriel Spark.", "answer": "novel", "quote": "Loitering with Intent Loitering with Intent is a novel by Scottish author Muriel Spark.", "original_document_number": 1}], "current_answers": ["novel"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "novel", "origin": "initial"}], "requested_slot_hint": "other"}
